* text=auto eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary

# The whole claim of native/vendor is that these files are byte-identical to their upstream tags,
# and native/verify-vendor.sh checks it. Line-ending conversion on checkout would break both, so
# these are passed through untouched. beats.cpp is diffed against vendor/wled/util.cpp, so it has
# to match them.
native/vendor/** -text
native/beats.cpp text eol=lf
